{"title": "Mental Inhibition", "pageid": 21192, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mental_Inhibition", "categories": ["Damage Rider As Source", "Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Mental Inhibition</b> is a passive feature that tires out a mind targeted by the ring's wearer.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a foe fails a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against one of your spells or actions, they gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mental Fatigue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\">Mental Fatigue</a> for 2 turns. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mental_Fatigue\"> Condition: Mental Fatigue </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mental Fatigue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\">Mental Fatigue</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a -1 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">saving throws</a> for every turn remaining.</li>\n<li>When it fails a Wisdom, Intelligence, or Charisma saving throw while having 5 or more turns of this condition remaining, the entity takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a><abbr title=\"Damage Rider As Source\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_rider_as_source\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage rider as source\">DRS</a></abbr> damage and is no longer mentally fatigued.</li>\n<li>Mental Fatigue has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 7 turns.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Mental_Inhibition\" title=\"Ring of Mental Inhibition\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Mental_Inhibition\" title=\"Ring of Mental Inhibition\">Ring of Mental Inhibition</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mental Fatigue\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Fatigue_(Condition)\" title=\"Mental Fatigue (Condition)\">Mental Fatigue</a> is not applied on saving throws made to shake off an <i>effect</i>. For example, if a creature is under the effect of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Person\" title=\"Hold Person\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/20px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/30px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/40px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hold Person\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/20px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Person\" title=\"Hold Person\">Hold Person</a>, it makes a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each turn to end the <i>effect</i>. Failing that saving throw does <i>not</i> apply Mental Fatigue.</li>\n<li>As of Patch 2 Hotfix 5, the condition is not applied to failed saves from weapon passive effects, coatings, clouds, or wall spells, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/20px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/30px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/40px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cloudkill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp/20px-Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Cloudkill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cloudkill\" title=\"Cloudkill\">Cloudkill</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stinking_Cloud\" title=\"Stinking Cloud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stinking Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Stinking_Cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stinking_Cloud\" title=\"Stinking Cloud\">Stinking Cloud</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wall_of_Fire\" title=\"Wall of Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/20px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/30px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/40px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wall of Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp/20px-Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Wall_of_Fire_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wall_of_Fire\" title=\"Wall of Fire\">Wall of Fire</a>. In these cases, the saving throw appears to be against the <i>area of effect</i> instead of the caster.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"New testing should be don...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Despite the description, Mental Inhibition also applies to allies.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200925\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2922/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30922/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11413/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 992660/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   63.866      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n1